{"3479640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sunny Blooms Garden Center", "steam_appid": 3479640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting from scratch, grow your garden center into a thriving business. Begin with the basics, expand your plant selection, design your layout, and turn your humble shop into a flourishing business <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/a0f580cfc2460bbeffe1f64009105b05.poster.avif?t=1776497541\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/a0f580cfc2460bbeffe1f64009105b05.webm?t=1776497541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/a0f580cfc2460bbeffe1f64009105b05.mp4?t=1776497541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your Stock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stacking supply crates can save floor space and keep your store organized—but be careful and don’t go overboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/b9373af6b9251dab53619d589768c5f5.poster.avif?t=1776497541\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/b9373af6b9251dab53619d589768c5f5.webm?t=1776497541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/b9373af6b9251dab53619d589768c5f5.mp4?t=1776497541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Promote your Store</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw in more customers by using a mix of promotional strategies </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/748cfad6f745535f099c023cf75f9abb.poster.avif?t=1776497541\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/748cfad6f745535f099c023cf75f9abb.webm?t=1776497541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/748cfad6f745535f099c023cf75f9abb.mp4?t=1776497541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add new Stock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilise any free space and add in shelves and plant stock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/807a10e609387693e76b2be54c8a19b7.poster.avif?t=1776497541\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/807a10e609387693e76b2be54c8a19b7.webm?t=1776497541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/807a10e609387693e76b2be54c8a19b7.mp4?t=1776497541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Base Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing in first person :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >purchase infrastructure and design a layout for your store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >buy plants and other items and arrange on suitable shelves and tables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >expand the store floor space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >perform daily store operations like restocking shelves and operating cash registers to keep your business running smoothly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >add staff to perform tasks as your business grows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >manage the finances and monitor customer ratings to increase customer numbers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >manage stock replenishment whilst considering supplier and competitor dynamics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >decorate and choose flooring that meets your taste</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting from scratch, grow your garden center into a thriving business. Begin with the basics, expand your plant selection, design your layout, and turn your humble shop into a flourishing business <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/a0f580cfc2460bbeffe1f64009105b05.poster.avif?t=1776497541\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/a0f580cfc2460bbeffe1f64009105b05.webm?t=1776497541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/a0f580cfc2460bbeffe1f64009105b05.mp4?t=1776497541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your Stock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stacking supply crates can save floor space and keep your store organized—but be careful and don’t go overboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/b9373af6b9251dab53619d589768c5f5.poster.avif?t=1776497541\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/b9373af6b9251dab53619d589768c5f5.webm?t=1776497541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/b9373af6b9251dab53619d589768c5f5.mp4?t=1776497541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Promote your Store</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw in more customers by using a mix of promotional strategies </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/748cfad6f745535f099c023cf75f9abb.poster.avif?t=1776497541\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/748cfad6f745535f099c023cf75f9abb.webm?t=1776497541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/748cfad6f745535f099c023cf75f9abb.mp4?t=1776497541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add new Stock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilise any free space and add in shelves and plant stock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/807a10e609387693e76b2be54c8a19b7.poster.avif?t=1776497541\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/807a10e609387693e76b2be54c8a19b7.webm?t=1776497541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/extras/807a10e609387693e76b2be54c8a19b7.mp4?t=1776497541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Base Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing in first person :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >purchase infrastructure and design a layout for your store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >buy plants and other items and arrange on suitable shelves and tables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >expand the store floor space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >perform daily store operations like restocking shelves and operating cash registers to keep your business running smoothly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >add staff to perform tasks as your business grows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >manage the finances and monitor customer ratings to increase customer numbers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >manage stock replenishment whilst considering supplier and competitor dynamics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >decorate and choose flooring that meets your taste</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Create your dream garden center! Design, decorate and stock it with stunning plants to wow customers and earn top ratings. Manage staff, suppliers, and finances to stay ahead of the competition. Take control of stock management, interact with cash registers and experience the day-to-day operations.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/d62660bd352873793f7e1b7adf601236256bc496/header.jpg?t=1776497541", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/58d02b20a2bd98dc66f02dff8d276867280aa658/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776497541", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479640/58d02b20a2bd98dc66f02dff8d276867280aa658/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776497541", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit versions only)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel I5 8400<br></li><li><strong>Memory